  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing the UN Plan of Action on Safety of Journalists through the Windhoek +30 Declaration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity seeks to support localisation of the UN Plan of Action on the Safety of Journalists and the Issue of Impunity as well as support follow up actions to the Windhoek +30 as a means to the implementation of the UN Plan of Action and Safety of Journalists. This activity s part of the Media4SDGs Programme of the UNESCO ROSA with an objective of strengthening Journalists and Media professionals Safety and Freedom of Expression in a bid to to enhance their role as the major drivers and vehicles for advancing access to development information for the achievement of Agenda 2030 and AU Agenda 2063 The Africa we want</narrative>
  </description>
